  m_Name: Faction_Hegemony
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: KryticalNova.Runtime::KryticalNova.Factions.FactionDefinition
  id: 1
  displayName: Hegemony
  tagline: Efficiency. Expansion. Ownership.
  lore: The Hegemony built their futuristic civilization on cold efficiency and boundless greed. Lacking the manual power to expand their high-tech cities, they turned to necromantic energy and advanced engineering to manufacture a synthetic workforce. Driven by corporate elites and enforced by heavily armored void-marines, Hegemony society treated their mechanical creations as disposable, torture-tested labor. When their urban sprawl breached ancestral wildlands, they treated native inhabitants with the same clinical indifference, viewing living souls merely as raw fuel for their necromantic generators.
